## 6. Factorial of a Number

```c
#include <stdio.h>

int fact(int);

int main()
{
    int num;
    printf("Enter int num:\n");
    scanf("%d", &num);
    printf("factorial: %d\n", fact(num));
    return 0;
}

int fact(int n)
{
    if (n)
        return n * fact(n - 1);   // multiplication
    else
        return 1;
}
```

**Stack trace for `num = 3`**

| Call | Condition | Returns |
|---|---|---|
| fact(3) | `if (3)` ✔ | 3 * fact(2) = 6 |
| fact(2) | `if (2)` ✔ | 2 * fact(1) = 2 |
| fact(1) | `if (1)` ✔ | 1 * fact(0) = 1 |
| fact(0) | `if (0)` ✘ | 1 |

